00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.000
please tag them below in the comments,

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.550
send them an email because
I really can't draw

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:22.383
to save my life.

00:10:22.383 --> 00:10:24.751
You don't wanna draw me
life from me doing it.

00:10:24.751 --> 00:10:27.730
Amoret, you should do medical ASMR.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.700
You know I've seen some
of these ASMR things.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.200
They're like people like
(rubbing fingers together)

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:36.860
doing noises like this
right? (scratches beard)

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.570
Is this a medical ASMR? (rubbing shirt)

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.420
(whispers) Hello.

00:10:41.521 --> 00:10:45.090
(whispers) Adele, can
you hear me now? (laughs)

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:48.820
Marcos Vinicius Garcia
Lazaro, hey Doctor Mike,

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:51.340
big fan, I have to use
the microwave every day

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:52.370
to heat my lunch at work.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.230
Is there any risk by doing that?

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:55.410
No, there's no risk.

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:58.200
Don't worry about microwaves,
period, end of story.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.900
Don't go on any of these crazy websites

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.757
where people are like "Microwaves
are gonna cause cancer

00:11:01.757 --> 00:11:02.610
"and kill you."

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.330
Yes, don't stand in front of the microwave

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.340
for long periods of time.

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.020
Use it, don't be afraid of it.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.770
If there comes out some breaking story

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:11.000
where we find out that microwaves are bad

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.000
for you because of proven research,

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.510
I will be one of the first people

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:18.370
to tell you that and you will
see it all across the news.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:20.530
You know, as I say, be alert, not anxious.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.330
Hey, doc, I recently
went through something

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.050
where a few surgeons changed my life

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:26.210
for the better and
honestly I'm so thankful.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.820
I feel like I owe them my life.

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:30.310
What are some good ways to
thank medical professionals?

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.330
Gifts, thank you letters,
just a verbal thanks

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.163
or anything else?

00:11:33.163 --> 00:11:33.996
Love your videos.

00:11:33.996 --> 00:11:36.410
Very happy to hear that you
had a positive medical outcome

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:37.260
from your surgeons.

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.740
Do something like this.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.167
It's called a letter of gratitude.

00:11:41.167 --> 00:11:43.775
Write a letter to whichever doctor

00:11:43.775 --> 00:11:47.480
that you think helped you along
your journey thanking them,

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:49.670
expressing your gratitude, being as open

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:52.600
and honest as possible
and don't send it to them.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:54.690
Either make an appointment to see them

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:58.030
or just drive by and for a social visit

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.380
and read the letter out loud to them.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.370
Not only is that gonna
be incredibly powerful

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:06.290
for them, but it's gonna
be powerful for yourself.

00:12:06.290 --> 00:12:08.750
In fact, we've seen
the letter of gratitude

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.880
as a psychological
experiment decrease symptoms

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.410
of anxiety and depression in people

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:18.900
for three, four weeks, six
weeks after reading the letter.

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:21.550
Write a letter of
gratitude and let me know

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.930
down below how that
whole process works out.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:26.060
You've done an amazing job asking me

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.710
some really tough questions!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:30.500
And you're helping me
stay sharp as a doctor

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.260
as much as I'm helping you
gain more medical wisdom.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.950
So keep your questions coming!

00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:36.220
Keep the humor coming.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:37.500
I'm really enjoying it.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.807
As always, stay happy and healthy!

00:12:39.807 --> 00:12:42.474
(upbeat music)

